Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hffffff&}ええっ！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.77,0:10:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hffffff&}（あかね）て… 天井に正座？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.23,0:10:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hffffff&}そないなざまで
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.73,0:11:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hffffff&}明日(あす)の茶月はんとの試合\N勝てますのか？
